# AI Transition: What is the big model?

2025 was the "big model year" for the defense industry. Heikang launched the big model, Da-hwa launched the big star-man model, and Woo-saw launched the big-ass model. All three told the same story: ** From "sell hardware" to "sell intelligence."**

# The big model progresses #

According to the official disclosure of the court:

- The big model has been extended to 2025 using the three-tier structure of "General Model plus Industry Model plus Mission Model"
- Deployment on a scale in **100 or more field projects** covering areas such as urban management, energy industry, business services
- Integration DeepSeek Large Model distills light-quantitative models and deploys them on end-side devices
- Support partners to train over **10,000 small models**, achieve over **300 million** value growth in **5,000 scenarios**
