In a bad word:** for most users, there is no significant difference**.

The security industry is highly homogeneous. A 2 million pixel web camera, which sells seacom, large-scale, and visual, and core parts (image sensors, chips) come from the same suppliers (Sony, Howie, Heiss/Using).

The technological differences in the vision are mainly reflected in:

1. **IT architecture gene**: Chinese-origin tricoms, technological accumulation in networking, IPization, suitable for large IT projects
