3. ** Partially disaggregated scenario**: innovative applications such as AI video chargers, sports smart analysis

But these differences** are not sufficient to constitute pricing rights**. The Māori ratio of the view **30% ** vs. Haikang ** 46% ** has already explained everything - products are very similar in the eyes of the client, and the view is competitive at lower prices.

